    "summary": "Added src/daemon/threads/channel.ts: the sc3 request-routing envelopes (RequestEnvelope, ReplyEnvelope, FrameEnvelope, CancelEnvelope, MethodClass, SessionId), the hub protocol (HubRequest answered by one HubReply, one-way HubMessage), serveHub for the main-thread side (unknown ops and throwing services answered with an error, never left unanswered), and HubClient for workers (request/send, replies matched by requestId, every pending request rejected with HubUnavailableError when the port closes; a payload that cannot be cloned rejects the request). Tests in src/daemon/threads/__tests__/channel.test.ts run a real worker over a MessageChannel; two falsifying mutations (replies matched in arrival order; no close handling) each fail their target test. The registry and status board are t4.",
